<title>AUSTRALIA: Westpac, Ansett, Visa in card launch.</title>
<headline>Westpac, Ansett, Visa in card launch.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp, Ansett Airlines Ltd and Visa International said on Monday they would launch a credit card linked to the Sydney 2000 Olympic Games, called the Global Reward Westpac Visa card.</p>
<p>The companies said the card would allow holders to earn frequent flyer points as well as various benefits linked with the Olympic Games.</p>
<p>Cardholders would receive a Global Reward point for every Australian dollar spent on credit purchases, which would be redeemable through Ansett's frequent flyer programme.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
